# keyval (PLAN.md Appendix A): build output, generated local state and run artifacts.
# .local/ holds node data dirs, logs, PID receipts and candidate/accept trees;
# artifacts/ holds crash packs, receipts and the failure outbox. Both are pruned only
# by ./dev prune (W46).
/target/
/.local/
/artifacts/
# reports/ is rendered on demand (./dev report traceability; §10.13), never committed.
/reports/*
# Audit reports are committed evidence (§11.9, W20: filed under reports/audits/).
!/reports/audits/
